<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Organization Notice</title>
<HTA:APPLICATION
    ID="orgNotice"
    APPLICATIONNAME="Organization Notice"
    BORDER="dialog"
    CAPTION="yes"
    SHOWINTASKBAR="yes"
    SINGLEINSTANCE="yes"
    SYSMENU="no"
    MAXIMIZEBUTTON="no"
    MINIMIZEBUTTON="no"
    SCROLL="no"
    ICON="#"
/>
<style>
    body {
        margin: 0;
        font-family: 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif;
        background-color: #f4f6f8;
        color: #1a1a1a;
    }
    .notice-box {
        background: #ffffff;
        padding: 20px 24px;
        box-sizing: border-box;
    }
    .header {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        border-bottom: 2px solid #0078D4;
        padding-bottom: 12px;
        margin-bottom: 16px;
    }
    .header h1 {
        font-size: 18px;
        color: #0078D4;
        margin: 0;
    }
    .content {
        font-size: 14px;
        line-height: 1.6;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .content ul {
        padding-left: 18px;
        margin: 10px 0;
    }
    .footer {
        text-align: right;
    }
    button {
        background-color: #0078D4;
        color: white;
        border: none;
        padding: 8px 18px;
        border-radius: 5px;
        font-size: 14px;
        cursor: pointer;
    }
    button:hover {
        background-color: #005a9e;
    }
    .updated {
        font-size: 11px;
        color: #888;
        margin-top: 14px;
    }
</style>
<script>
    window.resizeTo(520, 520);
    function centerWindow() {
        window.moveTo((screen.width - 520) / 2, (screen.height - 520) / 2);
    }
    window.onload = centerWindow;
    function closeNotice() {
        window.close();
    }
</script>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="notice-box">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>Apollo Knowledge Ventures Limitted</h1>
        </div>
	<h2>Organization Instruction</h2>
        <div class="content">
            <p>Welcome. Please read the following before using this system:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>This device is the property of the Organization and is provided for authorized business use only.</li>
                <li>All activity on this device may be monitored, logged, and recorded for security purposes.</li>
                <li>Do not store personal or sensitive data outside approved company folders.</li>
                <li>Report any suspicious activity, phishing emails, or security concerns to the IT Security team immediately.</li>
            </ul>
            <p>By continuing to use this device, you acknowledge and agree to the organization's IT Security Policy.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">
            <button onclick="closeNotice()">I Understand</button>
        </div>
        <div class="updated">Last updated: <span id="date"></span></div>
    </div>
    <script>
        document.getElementById("date").innerText = new Date().toLocaleDateString();
    </script>
</body>
</html>
